  "instructions": [
    "Cook rice stick noodles according to the package instructions.",
    "Drain and set aside.",
    "Heat 1 tsp of sesame oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "If using fish sauce and/or pork crackling, add and cook for a further minute.",
    "In a separate pan, combine hoisin sauce, rice vinegar, and 1 tbsp of water.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "To assemble the bun, place a portion of noodles into a bowl.",
    "Add a few slices of Parma ham on top of the noodles.",
    "Pour the sauce mixture over the ham.",
    "If desired, garnish with fresh herbs and Vietnamese chillies."
